{
  "id": "lendloopOverdue1",
  "name": "LendLoop 2: Overdue loan reminders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LendLoop 2: overdue loan reminders\n\nRuns daily at 08:00.\n\n1. **Fetch**: signed GET to Convex `/n8n/overdue-loans` (loans past their end date, not yet reminded today).\n2. **Loop**: one loan at a time, so a node retry only ever repeats the loan that failed.\n3. **Claim**: signed POST `/n8n/claim-reminder`. Convex marks the loan overdue and returns `claimed: true` only the first time for a given loan and day, so retries and re-runs cannot send a duplicate.\n4. **Remind** the borrower (only if claimed): by email through Amazon SES when `LENDLOOP_NOTIFY_CHANNEL=ses` (AWS key held in an n8n credential), otherwise via the mock sink.\n5. **Report back**: signed POST `/n8n/activity`, idempotent on its key, so the loan shows \"Reminder sent\".\n\nSignatures are hex HMAC-SHA256 of `timestamp.METHOD.path.body`.\n\nConfiguration comes from environment variables, so this export holds no secrets:\n`LENDLOOP_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `LENDLOOP_CONVEX_SITE_URL`, `LENDLOOP_NOTIFY_CHANNEL`, `LENDLOOP_NOTIFY_SINK_URL`, `LENDLOOP_SES_FROM`.\n\nFailures run the \"LendLoop: Error handler\" workflow.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "7a2c9d10-3b4e-4f61-8a2b-9e0d1c2b3a01",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2c9d10-3b4e-4f61-8a2b-9e0d1c2b3a02",
      "name": "Every day at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "7a2c9d10-3b4e-4f61-8a2b-9e0d1c2b3a15",
      "name": "Run now (manual test)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "9e0d1c2b-0001-4f61-8a2b-7a2c9d103b4e",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ Date.now().toString() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7a2c9d10-3b4e-4f61-8a2b-9e0d1c2b3a03",
      "name": "Stamp query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hmac",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.timestamp }}.GET./n8n/overdue-loans.",
        "dataPropertyName": "signature",
        "secret": "={{ $env.LENDLOOP_WEBHOOK_SECRET }}",
        "encoding": "hex"
      },
      "id": "7a2c9d10-3b4e-4f61-8a2b-9e0d1c2b3a04",
      "name": "Sign query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.LENDLOOP_CONVEX_SITE_URL }}/n8n/overdue-loans",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-LendLoop-Timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $json.timestamp }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-LendLoop-Signature",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "7a2c9d10-3b4e-4f61-8a2b-9e0d1c2b3a05",
      "name": "Fetch overdue loans",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
